<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<!-- Texto voltado pro público (Reino Unido) — inglês britânico de propósito (honour, organise, etc.), não americano. -->
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Terms of Use — {{ site_title }}</title>
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ site_url }}/terms.html">
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light dark;
    --bg: #0b0d12; --surface: #151822; --text: #eef0f4; --text-muted: #9aa1b2;
    --accent: #ff5f6d; --border: #262b3a;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
    :root { --bg: #f5f6f8; --surface: #ffffff; --text: #14161c; --text-muted: #5c6270; --border: #e4e6eb; }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); }
  main { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 2.2rem; }
  .updated { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  .back-link { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  address { font-style: normal; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <a class="back-link" href="index.html">← Back to {{ site_title }}</a>
  <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: {{ updated_at }}</p>

  <p>
    These terms apply to your use of this website and its daily deals email newsletter, run by
    {{ controller_name }}. By using the site or subscribing to the newsletter, you agree to them.
    See also our <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>, which covers how we handle your data.
  </p>

  <h2>What this site is</h2>
  <p>
    This site automatically curates and lists tech and gaming deals found on AliExpress. Listings
    are generated by an automated process based on discount and relevance, not individually
    hand-written for each product.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
  <p>
    Product links on this site and in the newsletter are affiliate links. If you make a purchase
    through one, we may earn a commission from AliExpress, at no extra cost to you. This never
    affects the price you pay.
  </p>

  <h2>No guarantee on prices or availability</h2>
  <p>
    Prices, discounts, and stock levels are set by third-party sellers on AliExpress and can change
    or sell out at any time after a deal is listed here — including between the moment it's posted
    and the moment you click through. We do our best to surface genuine discounts but cannot
    guarantee a listed price is still available when you arrive at the product page.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party sites</h2>
  <p>
    Clicking a deal takes you to AliExpress, a third party we do not control. Your purchase,
    payment, delivery, and any dispute about the product itself are between you and AliExpress (or
    the relevant seller), governed by their own terms.
  </p>

  <h2>No liability for purchases</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, {{ controller_name }} is not liable for any loss arising
    from a purchase made through a link on this site, including price or availability changes,
    product quality, or delivery issues — these are matters between you and the third-party seller.
  </p>

  <h2>Newsletter</h2>
  <p>
    The daily email newsletter is optional and requires double opt-in — see our
    <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a> for how sign-up and consent work. You can unsubscribe
    at any time using the link in every email.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms from time to time; the date above reflects the latest revision.</p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <address>
    {{ controller_name }}<br>
    Contact: <a href="mailto:{{ controller_email }}">{{ controller_email }}</a>
  </address>
</main>
</body>
</html>
